---
import I18n from '@/components/shell/I18n.astro';
import { profile, skills } from '@/data/profile';
import { domainKey } from '@/lib/i18n';
import { CONTACT_PATH, FOR_AGENTS_PATH, NOW_PATH, PRIVACY_PATH } from '@/lib/routes';

const domains = [...new Set(skills.map((s) => s.domain))];
const lp = Astro.locals.localePath;
---

<article class="px-4 py-14 sm:px-6" data-about-panel>
  <header class="mb-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-100 sm:text-4xl">
      {profile.name} · {profile.chineseName}
    </h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose-site">
    <p><I18n k="aboutLead" /></p>

    <h2><I18n k="aboutDoing" /></h2>
    <ul>
      <li><I18n k="aboutIos" /></li>
      <li><I18n k="aboutAi" /></li>
      <li><I18n k="aboutPkm" /></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="mb-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-100"><I18n k="aboutStack" /></h2>
    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        domains.map((domain) => {
          const key = domainKey(domain);
          return (
            <div>
              <h3 class="ui-section-label">{key ? <I18n k={key} /> : domain}</h3>
              <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
                {skills
                  .filter((s) => s.domain === domain)
                  .map((s) => (
                    <li class="text-sm text-ink-300">
                      {s.nameEn ? (
                        <>
                          <span class="i18n-zh" aria-hidden="true">{s.name}</span>
                          <span class="i18n-en">{s.nameEn}</span>
                        </>
                      ) : (
                        s.name
                      )}
                    </li>
                  ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          );
        })
      }
      </div>
    </section>

  <section class="mt-12 prose-site" data-about-howto>
    <h2><I18n k="aboutHowTitle" /></h2>
    <h3><I18n k="aboutHowArticlesTitle" /></h3>
    <p><I18n k="aboutHowArticlesBody" /></p>
    <h3><I18n k="aboutHowMachineTitle" /></h3>
    <p>
      <span class="i18n-zh" aria-hidden="true">同一地址在 <code>Accept: text/markdown</code> 时给出 Markdown。目录是<a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a>，说明写在<a href={lp(FOR_AGENTS_PATH)}>ethanchang.io 给 agent 的开发者资源</a>。Now 页在<a href={lp(NOW_PATH)}>Now</a>。</span>
      <span class="i18n-en">
        The same URL serves Markdown when the client sends <code>Accept: text/markdown</code>. Start at <a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a>. The stack is documented at <a href={lp(FOR_AGENTS_PATH)}>ethanchang.io developer resources</a>. The living status page is <a href={lp(NOW_PATH)}>Now</a>.
      </span>
    </p>
    <h3><I18n k="aboutHowContactTitle" /></h3>
    <p>
      <span class="i18n-zh" aria-hidden="true">写信到<a href={lp(CONTACT_PATH)}>联系</a>。收集了什么、没收集什么，写在<a href={lp(PRIVACY_PATH)}>隐私</a>。</span>
      <span class="i18n-en">
        Write via <a href={lp(CONTACT_PATH)}>Contact</a>. What is collected, and what is not, is on <a href={lp(PRIVACY_PATH)}>Privacy</a>.
      </span>
    </p>
  </section>
</article>
